SUMMARY:Fast Friends Toronto | Meet New People & Make Meaningful Connectio
 ns | 21-40
DESCRIPTION:Toronto 20's to 50's Singles Social (4000+)\nMaking new friend
 s as an adult isn't always easy—but it doesn't have to be awkward.\n\nJo
 in us for an evening designed to help you meet 15–25 new people through 
 our guided Fast Friends experience. Skip the awkward introductions\, enjoy
  relaxed conversations\, and stay afterwards for drinks with the people yo
 u connected with most.\n\nMost guests come on their own\, so whether you'r
 e new to Toronto or simply looking to expand your social circle\, you'll f
 eel right at home.\n\n✨ **This edition also includes a few fun themed co
 nversation rounds to help you move beyond small talk\, discover shared int
 erests\, and create genuine connections.**\n\nTickets\n🎟 **Book online 
 and save:** [ https://toroaug8th.eventbrite.co.uk](https://toroaug8th.even
 tbrite.co.uk)\nEarly Bird: CAD $10\nRegular: CAD $15\nAt the Door: CAD $20
  (cash) to the host Kruttika on the meetup day.\nBooking in advance helps 
 us plan the evening and guarantees your place.\n\n**What to Expect**\n🍻
  7:00 PM – Welcome & Drinks\nMeet your host\, Kruttika\, grab a drink\, 
 and settle in. If you're attending alone\, don't worry—most people do! O
 ur host will make introductions and help everyone feel comfortable.\n🤝 
 7:30 PM – Fast Friends\nEnjoy a series of short\, guided conversations w
 ith different attendees. No pressure\, no awkward approaches—just a fun 
 and easy way to meet a variety of friendly people. Throughout the evening\
 , we'll include a few themed conversation rounds to keep things fresh and 
 engaging.\n🍺 From 8:30 PM – Drinks & Mingling\nThe guided sessions en
 d\, but the conversations don't. Stay afterwards to chat with the people y
 ou connected with most.\n\n**Why People Love Fast Friends**\n✔ Meet 15
 –25 new people in one evening.\n✔ No awkward approaching strangers—w
 e guide the introductions.\n✔ Most attendees come solo.\n✔ Friendly\, 
 welcoming atmosphere.\n✔ Relaxed pub setting.\n✔ Themed conversation r
 ounds that help you skip the small talk.\n✔ Friendship-focused—not a d
 ating event.\n\nWho Is This For?\n✔ Ages 25–45\n✔ New to Toronto or 
 long-time locals\n✔ Solo attendees welcome\n✔ Anyone looking to build 
 genuine friendships and expand their social circle\nWe're not a closed gro
 up—new faces are always welcome\, and you'll never feel like an outsider
 .\n\nWhy We Use Tickets\nYour ticket helps us:\n• Organise the right ven
 ue space.\n• Support our local hosts.\n• Create a safer\, more committ
 ed group experience.\n• Deliver a well-organised evening for everyone.\n
 \nAbout Fast Friends\nFor over 10 years\, Fast Friends has been helping pe
 ople build meaningful friendships in 30+ cities around the world.\nOur mis
 sion is simple:\nTo make meeting new people easy\, relaxed\, and enjoyable
 .
